      ],
      "source": "https://villageoflyndon.org/things-to-do/lyndon-history/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Lyndon Historical Society Museum houses a library of about 200 volumes, a sizable collection for a newly settled town.",
